The frame where the animation changes always fails to `advance` immediately, and this is also the case in the `StateMachine` of `AnimationTree`. As a result, `advance_on_start` was later added to resolve this delay. However, I personally believe that it should be addressed fundamentally because you never know where else this 1-frame delay might exist.
